      },
      "text": "Discover Colombia: Bogotá, Cartagena and Villa de Leyva"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4974ad8592ee52eab01ab5cb596f51b7274192882621ddea2f5d8f637b990045",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-mw9pzmb9-dxwx6p3k",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Sol"
      },
      "text": "This itinerary takes you from the Andes through Colombia’s coffee region to the Caribbean coast. Explore Bogotá’s historic centre and main museums before visiting Zipaquirá’s underground salt cathedral and the colonial town of Villa de Leyva. The next leg takes you among the wax palms and coffee farms around Armenia. From the mountains, head down to the Caribbean coast to visit Santa Marta, Tayrona National Park and Cartagena."
    },
